  "details": "Build 1231 (and beta 1236)\nPressing R1 on a standard (xbox) style gamepad using the official bindings will not bring up the gesture wheel, nor change the current gesture. It will, however, prevent movement as if the wheels were open. \nSame behavior on two different computers: one with F310 controller and other with Xbox360 controller. \nThe button binding works as expected on a SteamDeck (albeit very finicky). \nRelated gamepad control binding issue: official gamepad binding for standard Xbox-style controller does not have mappings for DPAD left/right (specifically, cannot use DPAD right for AFK toggle, which the SteamDeck official bindings have)",
